  "articleBody": "Deciding when to bring in a professional for walker-friendly home modifications is key to ensuring safety and proper execution. You should definitely consider calling in experts like HH Remodeling LLC when the changes involve more than just moving furniture. For example, if you need to widen doorways, that's structural work that requires specific knowledge and tools. Bathroom reconstructions, like installing a roll-in shower or grab bars in just the right, sturdy spots, also fall into this category. Stair access can be tricky too, and often needs specialized solutions. If you're looking at significant changes or need to coordinate different trades like plumbing and electrical for your accessibility project, a seasoned contractor is your best bet. An occupational therapist can also be a huge help in figuring out exactly what modifications will work best for your specific mobility needs. We at HH Remodeling LLC can handle these more complex projects and ensure everything is up to code and perfectly functional. Don't hesitate to reach out to us at 303-505-0866 if you're facing these kinds of modifications.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}